<title>UK: Waldegrave says UK has no exchange rate target.</title>
<headline>Waldegrave says UK has no exchange rate target.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chief Secretary to the Treasury, William Waldegrave, said on Thursday Britain did not have an exchange rate target for sterling.</p>
<p>&quot;We do not maintain a target for the exchange rate and do not intend to do so,&quot; Waldegrave told the House of Commons during Treasury question time. -- London Newsroom +44-171-542-7768</p>
</text>
